Cell["\<\
As before, please write a paragraph each assessing your thoughts about prior \
homework.  Review the comments from the graders of your homework, if they\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve been posted.  This assignment is intended to be just one \
paragraph of worth-reading thoughts about each of the prior homework, not \
coding or further technical exploration.  Although, of course you are as \
usual free to pursue the spirit of this exercise in any way you deem to be \
meaningful and worthwhile engagement. \
\>", "Text",
