Cell[TextData[{
 "To determine dependence on kfast, we plot again with different kfast \
values.\nIncreasing kfast appears to both decrease the amplitude of initial \
oscillations in the trajectory plot as well as shrink the bounds of z in the \
parameterization plot. Below i show the plots for kfast values of 10,30,60, \
and 200\n",
