Cell[TextData[{
 "Using the same kfast variations as in problem 2 (10,30,60,200) this system \
appears to have less oscillations as compared to our previous model, and in \
general appears to have amplitudes that are inversely correlated with the \
kfast level as we saw previously but with a slight dip, from right to left we \
see a decrease in the amplitude of the concentrations, as kfast increases.\n\
",
